drydock-booking-no-ship = Ah cannae see yer ship. Hail me fae yer helm.
drydock-booking-too-big = That beast willnae fit in any o' me berths.
drydock-booking-full = Every berth that'd take yer ship is full up. Try again in a wee while.
drydock-booking-head-to = Berth { $berth } is yers, { $ship }. Follow the green lights in an' hold her steady.
drydock-booking-cancelled = Booking struck aff the ledger.
drydock-booking-expired = Yer booking fer berth { $berth } ran oot. Ah've gien it away.
drydock-booking-starting = Right! Cranes are swingin' on { $ship } in berth { $berth }.
